{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34806","headline":"寄赠诗僧秀公 · 司空图","name":"寄赠诗僧秀公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵一心传清塞心，可公吟後础公吟。\n近来雅道相亲少，惟仰吾师所得深。\n好句未停无暇日，旧山归老有东林。\n冷曹孤宦甘寥落，多谢携筇数访寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}